{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45168","headline":"送皇甫侍御曾还丹阳别业 · 皎然","name":"送皇甫侍御曾还丹阳别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云阳别夜忆春耕，花发菱湖问去程。\n积水悠扬何处梦，乱山稠叠此时情。\n将离有月教弦断，赠远无兰觉意轻。\n朝右要君持汉典，明年北墅可须营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}